        "section": "microbiology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Microbiology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HUMAN MICROBIOME:\n  ─ ~38 trillion bacterial cells in/on human body\n  ─ Roughly 1:1 ratio with human cells\n  ─ ~150x more microbial genes than human genes in gut\n  ─ Connected to: immunity, metabolism, mental health, drug response"
    },
