        "title": "Microbiology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ANTIMICROBIAL RESISTANCE (AMR):\n  ─ 1.27 million deaths/year attributable to AMR (2019, Lancet)\n  ─ Drug-resistant tuberculosis: ~500,000 new cases/year\n  ─ MRSA, CRE, carbapenem-resistant Acinetobacter: urgent threats\n  ─ New antibiotics: Very few approved since 1990"
    },
